    "Hi Alicia,
    
    That seems like a reasonable request. Our network follows a tiered system, starting with a Transmission Control
    zone, including an edge firewall and demilitarised zone. In the next layer, we keep our domain controller and
    general business/IT operations in an IT zone. Following this, we have an IT/OT bridge which can be used to 
    access a jumpbox in the OT zone. The jumpbox can access the OT devices on the network, however usually access 
    would occur internally from the human-machine interface. Attached is a network diagram. 
    
    Good luck with your project! 
    
    Kind Regards,
    
    Robert White
    Network assistant
    OT Solutions"
